{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Uthman ibn Sa'id al-Amri (r.a.)",
  "data": "At the tomb of Uthman ibn Sa'id al-Amri in Baghdad, recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَبْدُ الصَّالِحُ النَّاصِحُ لِلّٰهِ وَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَلِاَوْلِيَاۤئِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL A'BDUS SAALIHUN NAASIHU LILLAAHI WA LIRASOOLIHEE WA LI-AWLIYAA'IH\nPeace be upon you, O righteous servant, sincere to Allah, to His Messenger and to His friends,\nاَلْمُجِدُّ فِيْ خِدْمَةِ مُلُوْكِ الْخَلَاۤئِقِ اُمَنَاۤءِ اللّٰهِ وَاَصْفِيَاۤئِهٖ\nAL-MUJIDDU FEE KHIDMATI MULOOKIL KHALAA'IQI UMANAA'ILLAAHI WA ASFIYAA'IH\nearnest in the service of the sovereigns of creation, the trustees of Allah and His chosen ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْبَابُ الْاَعْظَمُ وَالصِّرَاطُ الْاَقْوَمُ وَالْوَلِيُّ الْاَكْرَمُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL BAABUL A'ZAMU WAS SIRAATUL AQWAMU WAL WALIYYUL AKRAM\nPeace be upon you, O greatest door, most upright path and most noble friend.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْمُتَوَّجُ بِالْاَنْوَارِ الْاِمَامِيَّةِ الْمُتَسَرْبِلُ بِالْجَلَابِيْبِ الْمَهْدِيَّةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL MUTAWWAJU BIL ANWAARIL IMAAMIYYATIL MUTASARBILU BIL JALAABEEBIL MAHDIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O you who are crowned with the lights of the Imamate and clothed in the robes of the Mahdi,\nاَلْمَخْصُوْصُ بِالْاَسْرَارِ الْاَحْمَدِيَّةِ وَالشُّهُبِ الْعَلَوِيَّةِ وَالْمَوَالِيْدِ الْفَاطِمِيَّةِ\nAL-MAKHSOOSU BIL ASRAARIL AHMADIYYATI WASH SHUHUBIL A'LAWIYYATI WAL MAWAALEEDIL FAATIMIYYAH\nsingled out for the secrets of Ahmad, the shining stars of Ali and the children of Fatimah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا قُرَّةَ الْعُيُوْنِ وَالسِّرَّ الْمَكْنُوْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA QURRATAL U'YOONI WAS SIRRAL MAKNOON\nPeace be upon you, O delight of the eyes and hidden secret.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا فَرَجَ الْقُلُوْبِ وَنِهَايَةَ الْمَطْلُوْبِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA FARAJAL QULOOBI WA NIHAAYATAL MATLOOB\nPeace be upon you, O relief of hearts and utmost of what is sought.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا شَمْسَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَرُكْنَ الْاَشْيَاعِ الْمُنْقَطِعِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SHAMSAL MU'MINEENA WA RUKNAL ASHYAA'IL MUNQATI'EEN\nPeace be upon you, O sun of the believers and support of the followers who were cut off.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى وَلِيِّ الْاَيْتَامِ وَعَمِيْدِ الْجَحَاجِحَةِ الْكِرَامِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA WALIYYIL AYTAAMI WA A'MEEDIL JAHAAJIHATIL KIRAAM\nPeace be upon the guardian of the orphans and the chief of the noble lords.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْوَسِيْلَةِ اِلٰى سِرِّ اللّٰهِ فِي الْخَلَاۤئِقِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAL WASEELATI ILAA SIRRILLAAHI FIL KHALAA'IQ\nPeace be upon the means to the secret of Allah among His creatures,\nوَخَلِيْفَةِ وَلِيِّ اللّٰهِ الْفَاتِقِ الرَّاتِقِ\nWA KHALEEFATI WALIYYILLAAHIL FAATIQIR RAATIQ\nthe deputy of the friend of Allah, who opens and who mends.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نَاۤئِبَ قِوَامِ الْاِسْلَامِ وَبَهَاۤءِ الْاَيَّامِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NAA'IBA QIWAAMIL ISLAAMI WA BAHAA'IL AYYAAM\nPeace be upon you, O deputy of the mainstay of Islam and the splendour of the days,\nوَحُجَّةِ اللّٰهِ الْمَلِكِ الْعَلَّامِ عَلَى الْخَاۤصِّ وَالْعَاۤمِّ\nWA HUJJATILLAAHIL MALIKIL A'LLAAMI A'LAL KHAASSI WAL A'AMM\nthe proof of Allah, the all-knowing King, over the elect and the common people,\nاَلْفَارُوْقِ بَيْنَ الْحَلَالِ وَالْحَرَامِ\nAL-FAAROOQI BAYNAL HALAALI WAL HARAAM\nthe one who divides the lawful from the unlawful,\nوَالنُّوْرِ الزَّاهِرِ وَالْمَجْدِ الْبَاهِرِ فِيْ كُلِّ مَوْقِفٍ وَمَقَامٍ\nWAN NOORIZ ZAAHIRI WAL MAJDIL BAAHIRI FEE KULLI MAWQIFIN WA MAQAAM\nthe shining light and the dazzling glory in every station and place.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ بَقِيَّةِ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ وَخِيَرَةِ اِلٰهِ السَّمَاۤءِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYA BAQIYYATIL ANBIYAA'I WA KHIYARATI ILAAHIS SAMAA'\nPeace be upon you, O friend of the remnant of the prophets, the chosen one of the God of heaven,\nاَلْمُخْتَصِّ بِاَعْلٰى مَرَاتِبِ الْمُلْكِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nAL-MUKHTASSI BI-A'LAA MARAATIBIL MULKIL A'ZEEM\nsingled out for the highest ranks of the great kingdom,\nاَلْمُنْجِيْ مِنْ مَتَالِفِ الْعَطَبِ الْعَمِيْمِ\nAL-MUNJEE MIN MATAALIFIL A'TABIL A'MEEM\nthe rescuer from the perils of universal ruin,\nذِي اللِّوَاۤءِ الْمَنْصُوْرِ وَالْعَلَمِ الْمَنْشُوْرِ وَالْعِلْمِ الْمَسْتُوْرِ\nDHIL LIWAA'IL MANSOORI WAL A'LAMIL MANSHOORI WAL I'LMIL MASTOOR\nbearer of the victorious standard, the unfurled banner and the hidden knowledge,\nوَالْمَحَجَّةِ الْعُظْمٰى وَالْحُجَّةِ الْكُبْرٰى\nWAL MAHAJJATIL U'ZMAA WAL HUJJATIL KUBRAA\nthe greatest way and the supreme proof,\nسُلَالَةِ الْمُقَدَّسِيْنَ وَذُرِّيَّةِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ وَابْنِ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nSULAALATIL MUQADDASEENA WA DHURRIYYATIL MURSALEENA WABNI KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN\ndescendant of the sanctified, offspring of the messengers and son of the Seal of the Prophets,\nوَبَهْجَةِ الْعَابِدِيْنَ وَرُكْنِ الْمُوَحِّدِيْنَ وَوَارِثِ الْخِيَرَةِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nWA BAHJATIL A'ABIDEENA WA RUKNIL MUWAHHIDEENA WA WAARITHIL KHIYARATIT TAAHIREEN\njoy of the worshippers, pillar of those who affirm His oneness and heir of the pure chosen ones.\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِمْ صَلَاةً لَا تَنْفَدُ وَاِنْ نَفِدَ الدَّهْرُ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYHIM SALAATAN LAA TANFADU WA IN NAFIDAD DAHR\nMay Allah bless them with a blessing that does not run out though time runs out,\nوَلَا تَحُوْلُ وَاِنْ حَالَ الزَّمَنُ وَالْعَصْرُ\nWA LAA TAHOOLU WA IN HAALAZ ZAMANU WAL A'SR\nand does not change though the age and the era change.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اُقَدِّمُ بَيْنَ يَدَيْ سُؤَالِي الْاِعْتِرَافَ لَكَ بِالْوَحْدَانِيَّةِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE UQADDIMU BAYNA YADAY SU'AALIL I'TIRAAFA LAKA BIL WAHDAANIYYAH\nO Allah, before my request I put forward my acknowledgement of Your Oneness,\nوَلِمُحَمَّدٍ بِالنُّبُوَّةِ وَلِعَلِيٍّ بِالْاِمَامَةِ وَلِذُرِّيَّتِهِمَا بِالْعِصْمَةِ وَفَرْضِ الطَّاعَةِ\nWA LIMUHAMMADIN BIN NUBUWWATI WA LI-A'LIYYIN BIL IMAAMATI WA LIDHURRIYYATIHIMAA BIL I'SMATI WA FARDIT TAA'AH\nof the prophethood of Muhammad, the Imamate of Ali, and the sinlessness of their descendants and the duty to obey them.\nوَبِهٰذَا الْوَلِيِّ الرَّشِيْدِ وَالْمَوْلَى السَّدِيْدِ اَبِيْ مُحَمَّدٍ عُثْمَانَ بْنِ سَعِيْدٍ\nWA BIHAADHAL WALIYYIR RASHEEDI WAL MAWLAS SADEEDI ABEE MUHAMMADIN U'THMAANABNI SA'EED\nAnd through this rightly guided friend and steadfast master, Abu Muhammad Uthman ibn Sa’id,\nاَتَوَسَّلُ اِلَى اللّٰهِ بِالشَّفَاعَةِ اِلَيْهِ\nATAWASSALU ILALLAAHI BISH SHAFAA'ATI ILAYH\nI seek a means to Allah, asking him to intercede,\nلِيَشْفَعَ اِلٰى شُفَعَاۤئِهٖ وَاَهْلِ مَوَدَّتِهٖ وَخُلَصَاۤئِهٖ\nLIYASHFA'A ILAA SHUFA'AA'IHEE WA AHLI MAWADDATIHEE WA KHULASAA'IH\nthat he may plead with those who intercede for him, the people of his love and his sincere friends,\nاَنْ يَسْتَنْقِذُوْنِيْ مِنْ مَكَارِهِ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nAN YASTANQIDHOONEE MIN MAKAARIHID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nthat they rescue me from the hardships of this world and the hereafter.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَتَوَسَّلُ اِلَيْكَ بِعَبْدِكَ عُثْمَانَ بْنِ سَعِيْدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAWASSALU ILAYKA BI-A'BDIKA U'THMAANABNI SA'EED\nO Allah, I seek a means to You through Your servant Uthman ibn Sa’id,\nوَاُقَدِّمُهٗ بَيْنَ يَدَيْ حَوَاۤئِجِيْ\nWA UQADDIMUHOO BAYNA YADAY HAWAA'IJEE\nand I put him forward before my needs:\nاَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَشِيْعَتِهٖ وَاَوْلِيَاۤئِهٖ\nAN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WA SHEE'ATIHEE WA AWLIYAA'IH\nthat You bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, his followers and his friends,\nوَاَنْ تَغْفِرَ لِيَ الْحَوْبَ وَالْخَطَايَا\nWA AN TAGHFIRA LIYAL HAWBA WAL KHATAAYAA\nthat You forgive me my sins and wrongdoings,\nوَتَسْتُرَ عَلَيَّ الزَّلَلَ وَالسَّيِّئَاتِ\nWA TASTURA A'LAYYAZ ZALALA WAS SAYYI'AAT\ncover my slips and misdeeds,\nوَتَرْزُقَنِي السَّلَامَةَ مِنَ الرَّزَايَا\nWA TARZUQANIS SALAAMATA MINAR RAZAAYAA\nand grant me safety from calamities.\nفَكُنْ لِيْ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ شَافِعًا نَافِعًا وَرُكْنًا مَنِيْعًا دَافِعًا\nFAKUN LEE YAA WALIYYAA ALLAAHI SHAAFI'AN NAAFI'AN WA RUKNAN MANEE'AN DAAFI'AA\nSo be for me, O friend of Allah, an intercessor who avails and an unassailable support who defends.\nفَقَدْ اَلْقَيْتُ اِلَيْكَ بِالْاٰمَالِ وَوَثِقْتُ مِنْكَ بِتَخْفِيْفِ الْاَثْقَالِ\nFAQAD ALQAYTU ILAYKA BIL AAMAALI WA WATHIQTU MINKA BITAKHFEEFIL ATHQAAL\nI have laid my hopes before you and trusted in you to lighten my burdens.\nوَقَرَعْتُ بِكَ يَا سَيِّدِيْ بَابَ الْحَاجَةِ\nWA QARA'TU BIKA YAA SAYYIDEE BAABAL HAAJAH\nThrough you, my master, I have knocked at the door of need,\nوَرَجَوْتُ مِنْكَ جَمِيْلَ سِفَارَتِكَ\nWA RAJAWTU MINKA JAMEELA SIFAARATIK\nand I hope from you for the kindness of your mediation\nوَحُصُوْلَ الْفَلَاحِ بِمَقَامِ غِيَاثٍ اَعْتَمِدُ عَلَيْهِ\nWA HUSOOLAL FALAAHI BIMAQAAMI GHIYAATHIN A'TAMIDU A'LAYH\nand for success through the standing of a helper on whom I rely,\nوَاَقْصِدُ اِلَيْهِ وَاَطْرَحُ نَفْسِيْ بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ\nWA AQSIDU ILAYHI WA ATRAHU NAFSEE BAYNA YADAYH\nto whom I turn and before whom I cast myself.\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWAS SALAAMU A'LAYKA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace be upon you, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings.\nThen pray the two-unit prayer of ziyarat and offer it as a gift to him and to those who shared the deputyship with him. Then bid him farewell, facing him.",
  "merits": "Allamah al-Majlisi writes in Bihar al-Anwar (vol. 102, pp. 292-293) that he found this ziyarat of Abu Muhammad Uthman ibn Sa'id al-Amri al-Asadi in some old manuscripts of the works of our scholars.\n\nUthman ibn Sa'id was a trusted companion of Imam al-Hadi (a.s.) and Imam al-Askari (a.s.), and the first of the Four Deputies of Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.) in the Minor Occultation. After him his son Muhammad ibn Uthman held the office. The ziyarat that is recited at the tomb of each of the four deputies, naming him, is [Ziyarat of the Four Deputies of Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.)](AM3)."
}
